    "description": {
      "content": "Public inference API for Pioneer AI. Covers the Pioneer-native endpoint, OpenAI-compatible endpoints (/v1/chat/completions, /v1/completions, /v1/models), the Anthropic-compatible endpoint (/v1/messages), and inference history. Authenticate with an X-API-Key header (keys begin with pio_sk_).\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Pioneer AI\n Email: support@pioneer.ai",
